      "content": "Offer the customer an immediate, full refund for the broken item to resolve the dispute quickly and maintain good customer relations. In addition to the refund, provide a free replacement of the vase to show commitment to quality and potentially win back their goodwill. This proactive approach often de-escalates the situation, preventing a formal chargeback while keeping your immediate loss limited to the product cost.",
